+      A1 = z O1 - H1 - U1 S U^dagger - U S U1^dagger + mu1 I.
+    S is the stored, fixed local Sigma-minus-double-counting. It is generally
+    non-Hermitian on the positive Matsubara axis. Do not Hermitize A1, multiply
